# Static Shoals' shoal cave (CIPlay static_shoals_caves, 11-12 w08). Run it in a new world whose name does NOT start with
# 'CI ' (e.g. 'W08 sscave'): in a 'CI ' world each `island` line empties the inventory and the machete is lost. Points as
# in its recipe: the vine-hung mouth in the shoal rock at -35 40 (facing the channel), the level tunnel west to the room
# round -58.5 40 (the relay spares crate at -60.1 42). The machete comes from Triangulation Rocks' survey camp, as in the plan.
# Shut by the vines, cut, walked in, the crate opened, walked back out.
island Triangulation Rocks
offset 0 0
open Survey camp
wait 3
expect item Machete 1

island Static Shoals
offset 0.8464 -0.6905
hour 11
weather Calm
where ChoppableVines
where Loot_ChestSmall

picture ss_cave_out -24.5 8 40.5 -35 5 40
walk -29.8 40 to -33.5 40 to -36 40 to -42 40 blocked
expect shown sscave_vines
use sscave_vines
expect hidden sscave_vines
walk -29.8 40 to -33.5 40 to -36 40 to -42 40 to -49.6 40 to -57 40.5 below=6
picture ss_cave_in -50 4.6 40 -60 4 41.5 light=20
open Relay spares crate
wait 3
expect item Battery 1
walk -57 40.5 to -49.6 40 to -42 40 to -36 40 to -33.5 40 to -29.8 40 below=6
